This directory is referenced by phpunit.xml's "Unit" testsuite. PHPUnit HARD
FAILS ("Test directory ... not found") if it is absent, which takes down
`make test-api3` and therefore all of `make test`.

Git does not track empty directories, so without this file the directory
disappears on a fresh clone and the whole v3/api suite — 71 tests — silently
stops running. That is exactly what happened between 2026-08-10 and
2026-08-11: local runs were green because the directory existed locally, while
the committed repo could not run those tests at all.

Delete this file only together with the "Unit" testsuite entry in phpunit.xml.
